### MakeIt — peticiones de ejemplo (extensión REST Client de VS Code)
### Ejecuta cada bloque con "Send Request"; las variables @name capturan la
### respuesta para encadenar las siguientes peticiones automáticamente.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### Salud de la API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Registro
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
@accessToken = {{register.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login (alternativa si la cuenta ya existe)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refrescar el access token (usa la cookie httpOnly devuelta por register/login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### Cerrar sesión
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### Crear un tablero (siembra columnas del template)
# @name createBoard
POST {{baseUrl}}/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Búsqueda de empleo",
  "description": "Candidaturas en curso",
  "template": "job-applications"
}

###
@boardId = {{createBoard.response.body.board._id}}

### Listar mis tableros
GET {{baseUrl}}/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ver un tablero con sus columnas y tarjetas
# @name getBoard
GET {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
@columnId = {{getBoard.response.body.board.columns[0]._id}}

### Editar el tablero
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Candidaturas activas este trimestre"
}

### Crear una columna
# @name createColumn
POST {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}/columns
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Seguimiento"
}

###
@newColumnId = {{createColumn.response.body.column._id}}

### Renombrar una columna
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/columns/{{newColumnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Seguimiento semanal"
}

### Crear una tarjeta
# @name createCard
POST {{baseUrl}}/columns/{{columnId}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend en Acme Inc.",
  "company": "Acme Inc.",
  "jobUrl": "https://acme.example.com/jobs/123",
  "labels": ["remoto"]
}

###
@cardId = {{createCard.response.body.card._id}}

### Editar una tarjeta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Entrevista técnica el jueves"
}

### Mover la tarjeta a otra columna
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "columnId": "{{newColumnId}}"
}

### Mover una columna (reordenar)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/columns/{{newColumnId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prevColumnId": "{{columnId}}"
}

### Borrar una tarjeta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Borrar una columna (y sus tarjetas)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/columns/{{newColumnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Borrar el tablero (y sus columnas/tarjetas) — solo admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
